{"text": "As he left the office, people crowded around him, asking questions with curious and mocking faces. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He told everyone about the string and even turned out his pockets, but nobody believed him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Get along, you old rascal, they said, laughing, and he grew angrier with every word they spoke. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That evening he walked home with three neighbors and showed them the place where he had picked up the string. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next day, around one oclock, a farmhand named Marius Paumelle returned the pocketbook to its owner. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He claimed he had found it on the road, but not knowing how to read, he had given it to his master. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Hauchecorne heard the news, he hurried around the village, telling his story again with its happy ending. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What hurt me was not the thing itself, but the lie, he said, for nothing hurts more than being called a liar. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Yet something still troubled him, for people smiled at his story as if it were only a clever joke. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He felt that they were whispering behind his back, but he could not understand why they still doubted him.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "s", " ", "h", "e", " ", "l", "e", "f", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "f", "f", "i", "c", "e", ",", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "c", "r", "o", "w", "d", "e", "d", " ", "a", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "h", "i", "m", ",", " ", "a", "s", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "q", "u", "e", "s", "t", "i", "o", "n", "s", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "c", "u", "r", "i", "o", "u", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "m", "o", "c", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "f", "a", "c", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "t", "o", "l", "d", " ", "e", "v", "e", "r", "y", "o", "n", "e", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u", "t"